    "guidlines": {
        "section_header": "GUIDELINES",
        "contents": {
            "paragraph": "<p>This report is designed to help the managers to appraise each employee, his work performance and potential abilities.</p><br><p>Competency is a standardized requirement for an individual to properly perform a specific job, which encompasses a combination of knowledge, skills and behavior utilized to improve performance. </p><br><p>This Appraisal Report will also provide to the Management information on each employees performance and skill development needs and in turn translate into a tool for rewards, financial or otherwise.</p><br><p>To serve this important purpose, the report must be prepared in a careful and thorough manner. Kindly go through the following points before filling up the appraisal forms.</p>",
            "guideline_point_list": [
                "Please complete the forms on the basis of the work that the employee has been doing during the period under review.",
                "Assessment should be indicated by appropriate points in the respective columns. ",
                "Base your assessment on direct knowledge and employee’s performance on the job.",
                "Have the rating reflect typical NORMAL performance. Avoid being influenced by recent instance of success or failure which is not typical.",
                "Name and designation of the Reporting, Reviewing and countersigning authorities must be written clearly to avoid difficulties for future reference.",
                "During appraisal, the rating and the overall rating should not be revealed to the employee.",
                "Mention atleast 2 technical training & 2 Non technical training.",
                "<span ><font color= 'red'>Please ensure that all the fields are filled and your signature is also recorded.</font color></span>",
                " By clicking the Save for Later button, the form is only saved for you to continue filling it in a later session. The only way to submit the form to portal is by clicking on the Submit button after filling in the entire form.",
                "<span ><font color= 'red'>Please note that you cannot Edit/Modify your form once you click SUBMIT button. Please ensure that all the particulars you have provided are correct.</font color></span>"
            ]
        }
    },
